{"id":"n2bf62f1ae4","headline":"Stock markets fall for 3rd day; Nifty down 96 points, Sensex slips to 72,480","summary":"Sensex and Nifty fell for the third consecutive day, with the Sensex slipping to 72,480 and the Nifty down 96 points. Rising crude oil prices and foreign fund outflows weighed on markets.","why":"The Sensex and Nifty are the main benchmark indexes of India's stock market. Foreign institutional flows and oil prices are key drivers for Indian equities.","category":"markets","event_type":"other","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Mumbai","country":"India","lat":19.08,"lon":72.88,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/business/stock-markets-fall-for-3rd-day-nifty-down-96-points-sensex-slips-to-72480-101790766923434.html"},"sources":[{"name":"Hindustan Times","url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/business/stock-markets-fall-for-3rd-day-nifty-down-96-points-sensex-slips-to-72480-101790766923434.html"}],"published_at":"2026-09-30T11:24:55Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"8eccee70f5203408","impacts":[],"why_moved":"Rising crude oil prices raise India's import costs, and foreign fund outflows reduced demand for Indian stocks.","backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-09-30T11:24:55Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-09-30T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/stock-market-trading-screen-8575459.jpg","alt":"stock market trading screen (illustration)","credit":"PriismaDesign","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/man-drink